"height":34},{"text":"것이","x":296,"y":1731,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"변하는","x":378,"y":1731,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"동안","x":492,"y":1729,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"30년간","x":575,"y":1729,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"변함없이","x":697,"y":1730,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"그대로","x":843,"y":1730,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"유지된","x":956,"y":1729,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":1070,"y":1729,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"가지가","x":1118,"y":1729,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"바로","x":1232,"y":1730,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"이더넷","x":1314,"y":1729,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"프","x":1426,"y":1732,"width":35,"height":28}]},{"text":"레임 형식이다. 아마도 이것이 이더넷 표준의 진실한 중심점이라고 할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"레임","x":169,"y":1792,"width":58,"height":38},{"text":"형식이다.","x":245,"y":1793,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"아마도","x":403,"y":1792,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"이것이","x":518,"y":1791,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"이더넷","x":632,"y":1791,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"표준의","x":743,"y":1791,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"진실한","x":856,"y":1791,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"중심점이라고","x":965,"y":1791,"width":201,"height":38},{"text":"할","x":1177,"y":1792,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1222,"y":1792,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1269,"y":1790,"width":72,"height":38}]},{"text":"64.3 링크계층스위치","words":[{"text":"64.3","x":169,"y":1906,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"링크계층스위치","x":335,"y":1903,"width":310,"height":46}]},{"text":"지금까지 스위치가 어떤 일을 하고 어떻게 동작하는지 정확히 알지 못했다. 스위치의","words":[{"text":"지금까지","x":169,"y":2005,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"스위치가","x":316,"y":2005,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"어떤","x":470,"y":2003,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"일을","x":553,"y":2003,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"하고","x":634,"y":2003,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"어떻게","x":718,"y":2003,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"동작하는지","x":829,"y":2003,"width":160,"height":38},{"text":"정확히","x":1010,"y":2003,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"알지","x":1123,"y":2003,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"못했다.","x":1202,"y":2003,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"스위치의","x":1327,"y":2003,"width":130,"height":38}]},{"text":"역할은 들어오는 링크 계층 프레임을 수신해서 출력 링크로 전달하는 것이다. 전달 기","words":[{"text":"역할은","x":170,"y":2065,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"들어오는","x":279,"y":2066,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"링크","x":434,"y":2065,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"계층","x":515,"y":2064,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"프레임을","x":595,"y":2065,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"수신해서","x":743,"y":2064,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"출력","x":887,"y":2065,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"링크로","x":969,"y":2065,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"전달하는","x":1080,"y":2065,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":1226,"y":2065,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"전달","x":1349,"y":2065,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"기","x":1430,"y":2064,"width":27,"height":38}]},{"text":"능에 대해서는 조만간 자세히 살펴볼 것이다. 스위치는 그 자체가 서브넷의 호스트와","words":[{"text":"능에","x":167,"y":2126,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"대해서는","x":248,"y":2127,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"조만간","x":399,"y":2125,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"자세히","x":517,"y":2125,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"살펴볼","x":634,"y":2125,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"것이다.","x":752,"y":2126,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"스위치는","x":873,"y":2126,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":1018,"y":2132,"width":33,"height":25},{"text":"자체가","x":1065,"y":2126,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"서브넷의","x":1181,"y":2126,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"호스트와","x":1328,"y":2126,"width":135,"height":38}]},{"text":"라우터들에게 투명(transparent)하다. 즉, 호스트/라우터는 프레임을 스위치가 아닌","words":[{"text":"라우터들에게","x":168,"y":2187,"width":199,"height":38},{"text":"투명(transparent)하다.","x":386,"y":2186,"width":371,"height":41},{"text":"즉,","x":776,"y":2189,"width":41,"height":36},{"text":"호스트/라우터는","x":835,"y":2187,"width":243,"height":39},{"text":"프레임을","x":1094,"y":2188,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"스위치가","x":1244,"y":2188,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"아닌","x":1395,"y":2188,"width":65,"height":38}]},{"text":"다른 호스트」라우터를 목적지로 해서 랜상으로 보내며, 중간에 스위치가 프레임을 받","words":[{"text":"다른","x":167,"y":2247,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"호스트」라우터를","x":246,"y":2247,"width":253,"height":38},{"text":"목적지로","x":513,"y":2247,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"해서","x":667,"y":2248,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"랜상으로","x":751,"y":2249,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"보내며,","x":895,"y":2248,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"중간에","x":1017,"y":2248,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"스위치가","x":1131,"y":2249,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"프레임을","x":1280,"y":2250,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"받","x":1430,"y":2250,"width":34,"height":36}]},{"text":"아서 다른 노드에게 전달하는 것을 알지 못한다. 프레임이 스위치 출력 인터페이스들","words":[{"text":"아서","x":166,"y":2308,"width":59,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":246,"y":2308,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"노드에게","x":328,"y":2308,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"전달하는","x":485,"y":2308,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":638,"y":2310,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"알지","x":719,"y":2310,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"못한다.","x":798,"y":2310,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"프레임이","x":920,"y":2309,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"스위치","x":1066,"y":2310,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"출력","x":1180,"y":2311,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"인터페이스들","x":1264,"y":2311,"width":200,"height":37}]},{"text":"중 하나에 도작하는 속도가 그 인터페이스의 링크 용량을 일시적으로 초과할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"중","x":165,"y":2371,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"하나에","x":210,"y":2369,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"도작하는","x":326,"y":2369,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"속도가","x":479,"y":2369,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":597,"y":2375,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"인터페이스의","x":646,"y":2371,"width":195,"height":38},{"text":"링크","x":860,"y":2370,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"용량을","x":935,"y":2371,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"일시적으로","x":1049,"y":2370,"width":164,"height":37},{"text":"초과할","x":1